<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 3.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 3.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on January 31.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
